<main id=\"mainContent\" class=\"pf\">
  <div class=\"pf-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i id=\"pfProgress\"></i></div>

  <section class=\"pf-scrolly\" id=\"pfScrolly\" aria-label=\"FY 2025-26 in squares\" data-aria-en=\"FY 2025-26 in squares\" data-aria-zh=\"用方块看 2025-26 财年\">
    <div class=\"pf-stage\" id=\"pfStage\" aria-hidden=\"true\">
      <div class=\"pf-paper\"></div>
      <canvas id=\"pfGrid\"></canvas>
      <canvas id=\"pfTiles\"></canvas>
      <div class=\"pf-labels\" id=\"pfLabels\"></div>
    </div>
    <div class=\"pf-steps\">
      <article class=\"pf-step pf-step--hero\" id=\"top\">
        <div class=\"pf-hero\">
          <p class=\"pf-kicker\" data-en=\"AFFLATUS · FY 2025–26 TRADING RECORD\" data-zh=\"AFFLATUS · 2025–26 财年交易记录\">AFFLATUS · FY 2025–26 TRADING RECORD</p>
          <h1><span class=\"pf-hero-num\" data-count=\"24.0\" data-prefix=\"+\">+24.0%</span></h1>
          <p class=\"pf-hero-lead\" data-en=\"Return on capital invested in the financial year to 30 June 2026. Behind the number: 237 executions across 33 US-listed stocks.\" data-zh=\"截至 2026 年 6 月 30 日的财年，按投入资本计算的回报。数字背后，是 33 只美股上的 237 次成交。\">Return on capital invested in the financial year to 30 June 2026. Behind the number: 237 executions across 33 US-listed stocks.</p>
          <dl class=\"pf-hero-stats\">
            <div><dt data-en=\"Stocks closed with a profit\" data-zh=\"实现盈利的标的\">Stocks closed with a profit</dt><dd>17</dd></div>
            <div><dt data-en=\"Best single trade\" data-zh=\"最佳单笔交易\">Best single trade</dt><dd>+33.1%</dd></div>
            <div><dt data-en=\"Median hold on winners\" data-zh=\"盈利交易持有中位数\">Median hold on winners</dt><dd data-en=\"3 days\" data-zh=\"3 天\">3 days</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <a class=\"pf-scroll-cue\" href=\"#pfStep1\" data-en=\"Scroll to see the year ↓\" data-zh=\"向下滚动，看这一年 ↓\">Scroll to see the year ↓</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class=\"pf-step\" id=\"pfStep1\"><div class=\"pf-card\">
        <span class=\"pf-card-kicker\">01 / 04</span>
        <h2 data-en=\"Every square is one execution.\" data-zh=\"每个方块，都是一次成交。\">Every square is one execution.</h2>
        <p data-en=\"Lavender squares are buys, blue squares are sells: 237 of them over twelve months, across memory, chips, optics, space and more.\" data-zh=\"紫色是买入，蓝色是卖出：十二个月里共 237 次，横跨存储、芯片、光通信、太空等方向。\">Lavender squares are buys, blue squares are sells: 237 of them over twelve months, across memory, chips, optics, space and more.</p>
      </div></article>
      <article class=\"pf-step\"><div class=\"pf-card\">
        <span class=\"pf-card-kicker\">02 / 04</span>
        <h2 data-en=\"The year accelerated into its final quarter.\" data-zh=\"这一年，在最后一个季度加速。\">The year accelerated into its final quarter.</h2>
        <p data-en=\"April to June carried 194 of the 237 fills — 82% of the year's activity — as AI-hardware names moved fastest.\" data-zh=\"4 月到 6 月贡献了 237 次成交中的 194 次，占全年 82%，正是 AI 硬件股波动最剧烈的阶段。\">April to June carried 194 of the 237 fills — 82% of the year's activity — as AI-hardware names moved fastest.</p>
      </div></article>
      <article class=\"pf-step\"><div class=\"pf-card\">
        <span class=\"pf-card-kicker\">03 / 04</span>
        <h2 data-en=\"Seven themes, one supply chain.\" data-zh=\"七个主题，一条供应链。\">Seven themes, one supply chain.</h2>
        <p data-en=\"Sorted by theme, the record reads like a map of AI hardware: memory, compute, custom silicon, Korean chipmakers, foundry, optics and space.\" data-zh=\"按主题归类后，这份记录就像一张 AI 硬件地图：存储、算力、定制芯片、韩国芯片股、代工、光通信与太空。\">Sorted by theme, the record reads like a map of AI hardware: memory, compute, custom silicon, Korean chipmakers, foundry, optics and space.</p>
      </div></article>
      <article class=\"pf-step\"><div class=\"pf-card\">
        <span class=\"pf-card-kicker\">04 / 04</span>
        <h2 data-en=\"Where the gains came from.\" data-zh=\"收益从哪里来。\">Where the gains came from.</h2>
        <p data-en=\"Each square is 1% of realized gains. Memory and storage produced 46.5%. Add the Korea ETFs, led by memory makers, and the memory chain reaches 58%.\" data-zh=\"每个方块代表 1% 的已实现收益。存储与内存贡献 46.5%；加上以存储厂商为主要权重的韩国 ETF，存储链合计达 58%。\">Each square is 1% of realized gains. Memory and storage produced 46.5%. Add the Korea ETFs, led by memory makers, and the memory chain reaches 58%.</p>
      </div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class=\"pf-statement\">
    <p class=\"pf-reveal\" data-en=\"One idea ran through the year: when AI demand hits a physical bottleneck, the bottleneck gets repriced. The best trades followed it — memory first, then custom silicon, then the chips around them.\" data-zh=\"贯穿全年的只有一个判断：当 AI 需求撞上物理瓶颈，瓶颈就会被重新定价。最好的交易都顺着它展开：先是存储，再是定制芯片，然后是周边的芯片公司。\">One idea ran through the year: when AI demand hits a physical bottleneck, the bottleneck gets repriced. The best trades followed it — memory first, then custom silicon, then the chips around them.</p>
  </section>

  <section class=\"pf-section\" id=\"fy2026Performance\">
    <div class=\"pf-heading pf-reveal\">
      <span data-en=\"02 / HIGHLIGHTS\" data-zh=\"02 / 精彩操作\">02 / HIGHLIGHTS</span>
      <h2 data-en=\"Six trades that made the year.\" data-zh=\"成就这一年的六笔交易。\">Six trades that made the year.</h2>
      <p data-en=\"Entry to exit, fees included. All six were held for a week or less.\" data-zh=\"从买入到卖出，已计入佣金。六笔持有期都不超过一周。\">Entry to exit, fees included. Five of the six were held for a week or less.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- Data owner for scripts/published-cycles.mjs (gross entry-to-exit moves); not rendered. -->
    <div class=\"pa-published-data\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">
<article class=\"trade-route\" data-rank=\"01\"><header><span>DRAM</span></header><div class=\"route-efficiency\"><strong data-chart-value>+16.7%</strong></div><div class=\"route-track\"><span data-chart-value>2</span></div></article>
<article class=\"trade-route\" data-rank=\"02\"><header><span>AMD</span></header><div class=\"route-efficiency\"><strong data-chart-value>+16.0%</strong></div><div class=\"route-track\"><span data-chart-value>1</span></div></article>
<article class=\"trade-route\" data-rank=\"03\"><header><span>SPCX</span></header><div class=\"route-efficiency\"><strong data-chart-value>+14.1%</strong></div><div class=\"route-track\"><span data-chart-value>0</span></div></article>
<article class=\"trade-route\" data-rank=\"04\"><header><span>SNDK</span></header><div class=\"route-efficiency\"><strong data-chart-value>+13.8%</strong></div><div class=\"route-track\"><span data-chart-value>34</span></div></article>
<article class=\"trade-route\" data-rank=\"05\"><header><span>AMD</span></header><div class=\"route-efficiency\"><strong data-chart-value>+8.9%</strong></div><div class=\"route-track\"><span data-chart-value>3</span></div></article>
</div>
    <div class=\"pf-highlights\" id=\"pfHighlights\"></div>
  </section>

  <section class=\"pf-section pf-section--tint\">
    <div class=\"pf-heading pf-reveal\">
      <span data-en=\"03 / SPEED\" data-zh=\"03 / 速度\">03 / SPEED</span>
      <h2 data-en=\"Fast when right.\" data-zh=\"判断对了，就快。\">Fast when right.</h2>
      <p data-en=\"All 63 profitable round trips of the year, by holding period and return. Hover a square to see the trade.\" data-zh=\"全年 63 笔盈利往返交易，按持有期与收益率排列。将鼠标移到方块上查看详情。\">All 63 profitable round trips of the year, by holding period and return. Hover a square to see the trade.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=\"pf-scatter-shell pf-reveal\">
      <div class=\"pf-scatter\" id=\"pfScatter\"><div class=\"pf-tip\" id=\"pfScatterTip\" hidden></div></div>
      <div class=\"pf-legend\" id=\"pfScatterLegend\"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class=\"pf-section\">
    <div class=\"pf-split\">
      <div class=\"pf-heading pf-heading--left pf-reveal\">
        <span data-en=\"04 / RIDING THE CYCLE\" data-zh=\"04 / 顺势而为\">04 / RIDING THE CYCLE</span>
        <h2 data-en=\"Staying with the memory cycle.\" data-zh=\"始终跟着存储周期。\">Staying with the memory cycle.</h2>
        <p data-en=\"Price change from the first purchase of the year to the best exit achieved. The theme was harvested by returning to the same names again and again, not by holding once.\" data-zh=\"从年内首次买入价到最佳卖出价的涨幅。这个主题的收益，来自一次次回到同一批标的，而不是买入后一直持有。\">Price change from the first purchase of the year to the best exit achieved. The theme was harvested by returning to the same names again and again, not by holding once.</p>
        <p class=\"pf-fine\" data-en=\"Measures the stock's move between two of our own executions, not a single-trade return.\" data-zh=\"衡量的是两次实际成交之间的股价变化，并非单笔交易收益。\">Measures the stock's move between two of our own executions, not a single-trade return.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=\"pf-journeys\" id=\"pfJourneys\"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class=\"pf-section pf-section--tint\">
    <div class=\"pf-split pf-split--book\">
      <div class=\"pf-waffle\" id=\"pfBookWaffle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>
      <div class=\"pf-heading pf-heading--left pf-reveal\">
        <span data-en=\"05 / CLOSING BOOK\" data-zh=\"05 / 期末持仓\">05 / CLOSING BOOK</span>
        <h2 data-en=\"Where the year ended.\" data-zh=\"这一年停在哪里。\">Where the year ended.</h2>
        <p data-en=\"Holdings at 30 June 2026 by market value. The whole book sat in the memory and custom-silicon chain the year had been trading.\" data-zh=\"2026 年 6 月 30 日按市值计算的持仓。全部仓位都落在这一年反复交易的存储与定制芯片链上。\">Holdings at 30 June 2026 by market value. The whole book sat in the memory and custom-silicon chain the year had been trading.</p>
        <ul class=\"pf-book-legend\" id=\"pfBookLegend\"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class=\"pf-section pf-ideas-section\" id=\"ideas\">
    <div class=\"pf-heading pf-reveal\">
      <span data-en=\"06 / NEXT RESEARCH UNIVERSE · SEP 2026\" data-zh=\"06 / 下一阶段研究标的 · 2026 年 9 月\">06 / NEXT RESEARCH UNIVERSE · SEP 2026</span>
      <h2 data-en=\"Ten ideas for the next orbit.\" data-zh=\"下一程的十个方向。\">Ten ideas for the next orbit.</h2>
      <p data-en=\"Ten US-listed companies across AI, semiconductors, power, space, biomedicine and web3, with the question that matters next for each.\" data-zh=\"十家美股公司，覆盖 AI、半导体、电力、太空、生物医药与 Web3，并列出每家接下来最值得关注的问题。\">Ten US-listed companies across AI, semiconductors, power, space, biomedicine and web3, with the question that matters next for each.</p>
    </div>
    <p class=\"pf-ideas-owner pf-hand\" data-en=\"Astra's ten\" data-zh=\"Astra 的十个\">Astra's ten</p>
    <div class=\"pf-ideas\" id=\"pfIdeas\"></div>
    <p class=\"pf-fine pf-center\" data-en=\"Research watchlist dated 26 September 2026. Order is editorial, not a target weight or ranking of expected returns.\" data-zh=\"研究观察名单，日期为 2026 年 9 月 26 日。排列顺序仅为编辑安排，不代表目标权重或预期收益排名。\">Research watchlist dated 26 September 2026. Order is editorial, not a target weight or ranking of expected returns.</p>
    <div class=\"pf-heading pf-heading--second pf-reveal\">
      <span data-en=\"07 / A SECOND OPINION\" data-zh=\"07 / 第二种看法\">07 / A SECOND OPINION</span>
      <h2 data-en=\"Ten more, from Claude.\" data-zh=\"再加十个，来自 Claude。\">Ten more, from Claude.</h2>
      <p data-en=\"Chosen independently of Astra's list. Three names made both — they carry a ✦. Hover or tap one.\" data-zh=\"独立于 Astra 的名单选出。有三家两边都选了，标着 ✦——把鼠标移上去，或点一下。\">Chosen independently of Astra's list. Three names made both — they carry a ✦. Hover or tap one.</p>
    </div>
    <p class=\"pf-ideas-owner pf-hand\" data-en=\"Claude's ten\" data-zh=\"Claude 的十个\">Claude's ten</p>
