    <p data-en=\"Source: Stake financial-year report pack, 1 July 2025 – 30 June 2026 (US equities; no Australian equities were traded). Return on invested capital = (closing value − opening value − deposits) ÷ (opening value + deposits), in US dollars. Trade returns use first-in, first-out matching and include brokerage; positions held before 1 July 2025 are excluded from trade-level figures.\" data-zh=\"来源：Stake 财年报告，2025 年 7 月 1 日至 2026 年 6 月 30 日（美股；期间未交易澳股）。投入资本回报 =（期末市值 − 期初市值 − 入金）÷（期初市值 + 入金），以美元计。单笔收益按先进先出配对并计入佣金；2025 年 7 月 1 日前已持有的仓位不计入单笔统计。\">Source: Stake financial-year report pack, 1 July 2025 – 30 June 2026 (US equities; no Australian equities were traded). Return on invested capital = (closing value − opening value − deposits) ÷ (opening value + deposits), in US dollars. Trade returns use first-in, first-out matching and include brokerage; positions held before 1 July 2025 are excluded from trade-level figures.</p>
