+       <h2><span data-en="TRUMP → INDUSTRY PRIORITY MAP" data-zh="特朗普政府 → 产业优先级地图">TRUMP → INDUSTRY PRIORITY MAP</span><span class="c">03</span></h2>
+       <div class="in"><div class="list">
+         <div class="li"><span class="k" data-en="AI STACK" data-zh="AI技术栈">AI STACK</span><span class="v" data-en="The export program explicitly spans chips, servers, accelerators, storage, cloud, networking, data pipelines, models, cybersecurity and sector applications. Federal support can include financing tools, but proposals remain subject to export controls and appropriations." data-zh="AI出口计划明确覆盖芯片、服务器、加速器、存储、云、网络、数据管线、模型、网络安全和行业应用。联邦支持可包括融资工具，但项目仍受出口管制与拨款约束。">The export program explicitly spans chips, servers, accelerators, storage, cloud, networking, data pipelines, models, cybersecurity and sector applications. Federal support can include financing tools, but proposals remain subject to export controls and appropriations.</span></div>
+         <div class="li"><span class="k" data-en="CHIPS + MATERIALS" data-zh="芯片与材料">CHIPS + MATERIALS</span><span class="v" data-en="Section 232 measures favor domestic semiconductor capacity, equipment and advanced packaging. The 6 August polysilicon action adds minimum import prices, a 15% duty on derivatives from 4 December and authority for domestic investment incentives across polysilicon, ingots, wafers and cells." data-zh="232条款措施倾向本土半导体产能、设备与先进封装。8月6日多晶硅行动进一步设置最低进口价，并从12月4日起对衍生品加征15%关税，同时授权对本土多晶硅、硅锭、硅片与电池片投资提供激励。">Section 232 measures favor domestic semiconductor capacity, equipment and advanced packaging. The 6 August polysilicon action adds minimum import prices, a 15% duty on derivatives from 4 December and authority for domestic investment incentives across polysilicon, ingots, wafers and cells.</span></div>
+         <div class="li"><span class="k" data-en="POWER + ENERGY" data-zh="电力与能源">POWER + ENERGY</span><span class="v" data-en="AI buildout increases demand for generation, grid equipment, interconnection, cooling and networking. The ratepayer pledge shifts incremental power and grid costs toward large data-center operators, while the 2026 economic program separately prioritizes energy dominance." data-zh="AI建设提高对发电、电网设备、并网、散热与网络的需求。电费承担承诺把新增电力和电网成本更多交给大型数据中心运营商；2026年经济纲领也单列“能源主导”优先事项。">AI buildout increases demand for generation, grid equipment, interconnection, cooling and networking. The ratepayer pledge shifts incremental power and grid costs toward large data-center operators, while the 2026 economic program separately prioritizes energy dominance.</span></div>
+         <div class="li"><span class="k" data-en="REAL ECONOMY" data-zh="实体经济">REAL ECONOMY</span><span class="v" data-en="The 2026 Economic Report identifies resilient industrial supply chains, the defense industrial base and housing supply as explicit priorities. These are policy directions, not guarantees for every company: procurement, permitting, labor, financing and tariff incidence determine outcomes." data-zh="《2026年总统经济报告》把产业供应链韧性、国防工业基础与住房供给列为明确优先事项。这些是政策方向，不代表每家公司都能受益；采购、许可、劳动力、融资与关税归宿决定最终结果。">The 2026 Economic Report identifies resilient industrial supply chains, the defense industrial base and housing supply as explicit priorities. These are policy directions, not guarantees for every company: procurement, permitting, labor, financing and tariff incidence determine outcomes.</span></div>
+       </div><p class="note" data-i18n-html data-en="Official framework: <a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/cea/2026-erp/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>2026 Economic Report</a>, <a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/07/promoting-the-export-of-the-american-ai-technology-stack/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>AI stack exports</a>, <a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/01/adjusting-imports-of-semiconductors-semiconductor-manufacturing-equipment-and-their-derivative-products-into-the-united-states/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>semiconductor action</a>, and the <a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/08/adjusting-imports-of-polysilicon-and-its-derivatives-into-the-united-states/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>6 August polysilicon action</a>. Policy exposure is not a government endorsement or investment recommendation." data-zh="正式框架：<a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/cea/2026-erp/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>《2026年总统经济报告》</a>、<a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/07/promoting-the-export-of-the-american-ai-technology-stack/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>AI技术栈出口</a>、<a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/01/adjusting-imports-of-semiconductors-semiconductor-manufacturing-equipment-and-their-derivative-products-into-the-united-states/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>半导体行动</a>与<a href='https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/08/adjusting-imports-of-polysilicon-and-its-derivatives-into-the-united-states/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>8月6日多晶硅行动</a>。政策同向不代表政府背书，也不构成投资建议。">Official framework: <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/cea/2026-erp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">2026 Economic Report</a>, <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/07/promoting-the-export-of-the-american-ai-technology-stack/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AI stack exports</a>, <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/01/adjusting-imports-of-semiconductors-semiconductor-manufacturing-equipment-and-their-derivative-products-into-the-united-states/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">semiconductor action</a>, and the <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/08/adjusting-imports-of-polysilicon-and-its-derivatives-into-the-united-states/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">6 August polysilicon action</a>. Policy exposure is not a government endorsement or investment recommendation.</p></div>
